{
  "title": "The Holy Prophet's (s) dua",
  "data": "Fourteenth: this supplicatory prayer is ascribed to the Holy Prophet (s):\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْۤ اَعُوْذُ بِكَ اَنْ اَفْتَقِرَ فِىْ غِنَاكَ اَوْ اَضِلَّ فِىْ هُدَاكَ اَوْ اَذِلَّ فِىْ عِزِّكَ اَوْ اُضَامَ فِىْ سُلْطَانِكَ اَوْ اُضْطَهَدَ وَالْاَمْرُ اِلَيْكَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE A'OOZU BIKA AN AFTAQIRA FEE GHINAAKA AW ADILLA FEE HUDAAKA AW AZILLA FEE I'ZZIKA AW UDAAMA FEE SULTAANIKA AW UDTAHADA WAL AMRU ILAYK\nO Allah, I seek refuge in You from becoming poor amid Your riches, straying amid Your guidance, being humiliated amid Your might, being wronged amid Your dominion, or being oppressed — the matter being entirely in Your hands,\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْۤ اَعُوْذُ بِكَ اَنْ اَقُوْلَ زُوْرًا اَوْ اَغْشٰى فُجُوْرًا اَوْ اَكُوْنَ بِكَ مَغْرُوْرًا\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE A'OOZU BIKA AN AQOOLA ZOORAN AW AGHSHAA FUJOORAN AW AKOONA BIKA MAGHROORAA\nO Allah, I seek refuge in You from speaking falsehood, committing indecency, or being deluded about You."
}
